       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    BILLRPT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  FIBERNET - OUTSTANDING BILL REPORT                             
      *  FUNCTION : List every bill that is not fully paid, ordered by  
      *             customer (via logical file BILLMAST1), and print a  
      *             grand total of the outstanding balance.             
      *  OUTPUT  : Printer file BILLRPTP (spooled).                     
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT BILLMAST1 ASSIGN TO DATABASE-BILLMAST1
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-BILL-STS.
           SELECT REPORT ASSIGN TO PRINTER-BILLRPTP
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-RPT-STS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  BILLMAST1 LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF BILLMAST1.
       FD  REPORT    LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF BILLRPTP.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-STATUS-FLAGS.
           05  WS-BILL-STS     PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
           05  WS-RPT-STS      PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-EOF-SW           PIC X(01) VALUE "N".
           88  END-OF-BILL               VALUE "Y".
       01  WS-ANY-SW           PIC X(01) VALUE "N".
           88  ANY-PRINTED               VALUE "Y".
       01  WS-BALANCE          PIC 9(09)V99 VALUE ZEROS.
       01  WS-TOTAL            PIC 9(11)V99 VALUE ZEROS.
       01  WS-CURR-DATE        PIC X(21).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       000-MAIN.
           OPEN INPUT  BILLMAST1.
           OPEN OUTPUT REPORT.
           MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-CURR-DATE.
           MOVE WS-CURR-DATE(1:8) TO RPTDT.
           MOVE 1 TO PAGENO.
           WRITE HDR.
           READ BILLMAST1 NEXT
               AT END SET END-OF-BILL TO TRUE
           END-READ.
           PERFORM 100-PROCESS UNTIL END-OF-BILL.
           IF ANY-PRINTED
               MOVE WS-TOTAL TO TBAL
               WRITE TOTAL
           ELSE
               WRITE NODATA
           END-IF.
           CLOSE BILLMAST1 REPORT.
           GOBACK.

       100-PROCESS.
           IF BILLSTS NOT = "P"
               COMPUTE WS-BALANCE =
                   BILLAMT OF BILLREC - BPAID OF BILLREC
               MOVE BILLNO  TO PBILLNO
               MOVE BCUSTID TO PCUST
               MOVE BILLYM  TO PPER
               MOVE BILLAMT OF BILLREC TO PAMT
               MOVE BPAID   OF BILLREC TO PPAID
               MOVE WS-BALANCE TO PBAL
               MOVE BILLSTS TO PSTS
               WRITE DETAIL
               ADD WS-BALANCE TO WS-TOTAL
               SET ANY-PRINTED TO TRUE
           END-IF.
           READ BILLMAST1 NEXT
               AT END SET END-OF-BILL TO TRUE
           END-READ.
